      "contribution": "Developed grouped singleton/doubleton deletion and its recurrence; identified and specialized the bipartite allocation theorem to prove sharp quartic and quintic capacities; independently audited the free-action, branch separation, interval bounds and cubic matching proof. Developed the uniform-degree twelve-round corollary.",
